empt to crack the case  so to do Woodsboro sheriff Dewey Riley  and his wife Gale weathers Riley it's a  fight against time circumstance and  traumatic history to rid Woodsboro of  Ghostface for good and Netflix  subscribers have until October 7th to  find out how it all ends directed by the  region filmmaker morten tyldum and based  on the Andrew Hodges written biography  Alan Turing the Enigma 2014's the  imitation game tells the incredible true  life story a british cryptanalysis Alan  Turing who worked as part of the British  government's cryptography team during  World War two and decrypted the thought  to be unbreakable German codes  transmitted by the countries and nygma  machine throughout the course of the  film it's revealed that Turing is gay  which is punishable by law in England at  the time and complicates Turing's  personal and professional lives the end  of the imitation game will stir even the  steel iasts of people leaving little  question as to why the film won an  Academy Award in 2015 or why critics  have praised it as quote a moving  tribute to an extraordinary man the  imitation game is available to stream on  Netflix until October 29 check out one  of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite stuff are coming soon subscribe  to our YouTube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

